{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41681","headline":"旅泊涂江 · 陈陶","name":"旅泊涂江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟雨南江一叶微，松潭渔父夜相依。\n断沙鴈起金精出，孤岭猨愁木客归。\n楚国柑橙劳梦想，丹陵霞鹤间音徽。\n无因得似沧溟叟，始忆离巢已倦飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}